---
<ContentLayout title="Practical desk setup guides | StackGeist" description="Practical desk and gaming setup guides: layout, cable management, cheap upgrades, dock compatibility, input fit, and better video calls." active="guides">
  <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">StackGeist</a> / Guides</p>
  <p class="page-kicker">guides /</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Practical guides that help you decide, not shop.</h1>
  <p class="page-lead">Each guide covers one desk decision end to end. Read the two or three that match your bottleneck and skip the rest.</p>

  <section class="content-section cards">
    {guides.map((g)=>(
      <a class="card" href={`/guides/${g.slug}`}>
        <p class="page-kicker">{g.kicker}</p>
        <h2>{g.title}</h2>
        <p>{g.desc}</p>
      </a>
    ))}
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <p class="page-kicker">Next</p>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href="/setups"><h3>Browse setups</h3><p>Match a full desk to your room and budget instead of a single decision.</p></a>
      <a class="card" href="/gear"><h3>Browse verified gear</h3><p>Jump straight to fit-first product pages when you already know what to buy.</p></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
